    },
    "structure_location": "P63/mmc hcp substitutional model: Fe0.84Si0.16 on 2c. Source identifies the hcp topology but does not refine chemical site occupancies; these enforce the measured bulk composition. Reference axes derive from 2014 Table S1 row 19 at 59.3958006581 GPa and 1186.915 K, not ambient conditions. The fixed structural c/a is a diffraction reference, not an EOS prediction of anisotropic compression."
